      "text": "sons of Levi shall offer unto the Lord offering in righteousness, D&C 13 (128:24). Saints to offer sacraments in house of prayer, D&C 59:9. sons of Moses and Aaron shall offer acceptable offering, D&C 84:31. part of temple to be dedicated for sacrament offering and offering of holy desires, D&C 95:16. offering of Zion accepted, D&C 97:27 (105:19). Abraham commanded to offer Isaac, D&C 101:4 (132:36). the Lord will accept incomplete offerings if Saints be hindered by enemies, D&C 124:49. the Lord will not accept of offering not made in his name, D&C 132:9. the Lord requires offering by covenant and sacrifice, D&C 132:51.",
