      "text": "angel asks Adam why he offers sacrifices to the Lord, Moses 5:6. Satan commands Cain to make offering unto the Lord, Moses 5:18. Cain brings fruit of ground as offering to the Lord, Moses 5:19. the Lord respects Abel’s offering, but not Cain’s, Moses 5:20–21. Pharaoh offered human sacrifice to strange gods, Abr. 1:8–11. priests try to offer Abraham as sacrifice, Abr. 1:15. Abraham makes offering to the Lord, Abr. 2:17–18. Joseph Smith offers up desire of heart to God, JS—H 1:15. priesthood never to be taken until sons of Levi offer an offering unto the Lord, JS—H 1:69.",
